Proof of Concept
Consider a scenario where a user has received specific approval for token ID
123
to facilitate a token merge or withdrawal. Under the current implementation, if this user attempts to initiate these actions, the transaction will revert during the
_burn
call due to the internal
approve
function not recognizing their limited approval as sufficient.
