Finding:
A warden identified that callers could bypass a permissions check in
MIMOProxy#execute
by passing specially constructed calldata, enabling the caller to invoke a contract’s fallback function.
What changed:
MIMOProxy#execute
now reads the first four bytes of the
data
parameter directly rather than using
data.offset
to extract the function selector from calldata.
