341                _changeStatus(Status.bothOraclesUntrusted);
342 return lastGoodPrice;
343            }
----end of code block ----
However, if the price is requested again and the Chainlink price still returns a price change over 50% from the previous round, having the status set to
bothOraclesUntrusted
will cause the condition of line 220 to evaluate to true and, given that the fallback oracle is not set and the Chainlink oracle is neither broken nor frozen, the price returned will be the current Chainlink price.
