Partial Execution Risk:
Users may end up with unintended tokens if the swap route cannot be fully executed.
Financial loss:
Without atomicity, users may incur losses due to incomplete swaps.
Deteriorated user experience:
Users are exposed to complex recovery procedures and additional steps to recovery the funds from the incomplete swap operation.
