Summary
A critical vulnerability exists in the
abortBidTaker()
function where an incorrect calculation leads to rounding errors, potentially causing
takers to lose all their deposited funds during bid abortion.
Vulnerability Details
Overview
The vulnerability stems from an incorrect formula used in the
abortBidTaker()
function where the deposit amount is calculated as follows:
uint256 depositAmount = stockInfo.points.mulDiv(preOfferInfo.points, preOfferInfo.amount, Math.Rounding.Floor);
