getConstantProductWell
. As the oracle is used along the protocol in many places, the
latest successful price
would be often up-to-date and within the limit time defined to use the previous price when the chainlink oracle fails.
Additionally, consider handling the errors properly before updating the
deltaB
and
abovePeg
variables, as these disrupt the peg mechanism logic.

