- is the amount of gas that is beyond the operator's trust limit to refund it back later.
Note: the operator's trust limit is guaranteed to be at least
MAX_GAS_PER_TRANSACTION
which is at the moment
80000000
(check
SystemConfig.json
).
Ensure that the deposited eth covers
