There is a missing check in
DLOImplementation::addFunds
function that allows adding funds to an inactive offer.
https://github.com/sherlock-audit/2024-11-debita-finance-v3/blob/main/Debita-V3-Contracts/contracts/DebitaLendOffer-Implementation.sol#L162-L176
----new code block----
 function addFunds(uint amount) public nonReentrant {
 require(
 msg.sender == lendInformation.owner ||
                IAggregator(aggregatorContract).isSenderALoan(msg.sender),
 "Only owner or loan"
        );
        SafeERC20.safeTransferFrom(
            IERC20(lendInformation.principle),
 msg.sender,
