Recommended Mitigation Steps
Blacklisted addresses can be checked against supporting quote tokens before they are set to
vault.recipient
in
PredyPool.updateRecepient
. In the case of USDC, this would involve calling the USDC contract's
isBlacklisted
method for supplied addresses. Ensure that this does introduce any callback/reentrancy issues by also making
PredyPool.updateRecepient
nonreentrant.
