As an example, using this calculation, we can find out that in order to withdraw 10 tokens with 0 decimals it would take 2 different calls to withdraw the full amount while avoiding fees, for 10 tokens and 2 decimals 112 different calls. Making tokens with low decimals very susceptible to this attack as it would be profitable for malicious actors to split their withdraw in multiple calls to avoid paying the
