This
JBTiered721Delegate._totalRedemptionWeight
function is then called in the
JB721Delegate.redeemParams
function, which ultimately calculates the
reclaimAmount
given an overflow and
_decodedTokenIds
.
uint256 _base = PRBMath.mulDiv(_data.overflow, _redemptionWeight, _total);
in
line 142
will lead to a lower
_base
due to the inflated denumerator
_total
